# Exclude everything by default, whitelist only compile inputs.
# Keeps build context <2 MB (target/ alone is ~4 GB) and stops unrelated
# file edits from busting the Docker layer cache.
#
# NOTE: a directory must be re-included before its contents can be, so each
# whitelisted path lists both the dir and its /** glob.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!src/**
!profiles
!profiles/**
!prefit
!prefit/**
